[{"client_msg_id":"74519688-bc45-42dc-80cb-74e05b89e155","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"ご存じの方がもしいたら…m(_ _)m\n\u003chttps://twitter.com/gorilla0513/status/1438829420270088196?s=20\u003e","ts":"1631879422.080900","thread_ts":"1631879422.080900","attachments":[{"fallback":"\u003chttps://twitter.com/gorilla0513|@gorilla0513\u003e: MySQLでListパーティションにサブパーティションを分けたいんだけど、ALTER文がsyntax errorになる\nなんでだろ\nどこか間違っているんだろうか\n------\nALTER TABLE table_a\nPARTITION BY LIST COLUMNS(a) (\n    PARTITION type_p1 VALUES IN (\"x\", \"y\", \"z\")\n)\nSUBPARTITION BY KEY(key) PARTITIONS 55;","id":1,"author_name":"ゴリラ@無","author_subname":"@gorilla0513","author_link":"https://twitter.com/gorilla0513/status/1438829420270088196","author_icon":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1348486174914957314/-RJqWxMK_normal.jpg","text":"MySQLでListパーティションにサブパーティションを分けたいんだけど、ALTER文がsyntax errorになる\nなんでだろ\nどこか間違っているんだろうか\n------\nALTER TABLE table_a\nPARTITION BY LIST COLUMNS(a) (\n    PARTITION type_p1 VALUES IN (\"x\", \"y\", \"z\")\n)\nSUBPARTITION BY KEY(key) PARTITIONS 55;","blocks":null,"footer":"Twitter","footer_icon":"https://a.slack-edge.com/80588/img/services/twitter_pixel_snapped_32.png","ts":1631878640,"service_name":"twitter","from_url":"https://twitter.com/gorilla0513/status/1438829420270088196?s=20","original_url":"https://twitter.com/gorilla0513/status/1438829420270088196?s=20"}],"reply_count":34,"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"+i+1"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9ed7414e-9b30-4b96-940c-4fd1e699b3a4","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"エラーメッセージ出てるなら、共有できないですか?","ts":"1631880243.081100","thread_ts":"1631879422.080900","parent_user_id":"UDDCM376D","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"e+Re"}]},{"client_msg_id":"93686e29-13c9-46d6-ae29-515835d719cd","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"```(1064, \"You have an error in your SQL syntax; check the manual that corresponds to your MySQL server version for the right syntax to use near 'SUBPARTITION BY KEY(key) PARTITIONS 100' at line 9\")```","ts":"1631880365.081300","thread_ts":"1631879422.080900","parent_user_id":"UDDCM376D","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"IOt"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1425dcaa-9c9f-4701-989c-15c137ade26b","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"このエラーメッセージが出ています","ts":"1631880373.081500","thread_ts":"1631879422.080900","parent_user_id":"UDDCM376D","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"3SA"}]},{"client_msg_id":"60525e60-d840-4a13-94bd-8a7bdfe6c324","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"かいてないけど","ts":"1631880551.081700","thread_ts":"1631879422.080900","parent_user_id":"UDDCM376D","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"H7Bx0"}]},{"client_msg_id":"cd848298-7aa7-48dd-8476-81a9cb6e0eac","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"add partition?","ts":"1631880569.081900","thread_ts":"1631879422.080900","parent_user_id":"UDDCM376D","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Bo9"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e891204f-17c4-4a83-93cd-39223327c1f6","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"試してみます","ts":"1631880922.082100","thread_ts":"1631879422.080900","parent_user_id":"UDDCM376D","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"fa4FD"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2da1d7b7-f5a8-4c06-9149-8aa7ef613a01","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"alter tableのマニュアルのpartition operationsにはadd partitionはあるけどpartitionが見当たらなかったので、どうなったるのかなぁってなりました。","ts":"1631881149.082300","thread_ts":"1631879422.080900","parent_user_id":"UDDCM376D","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Zh/e"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e1bf967a-b387-48f0-8e33-98e517f59953","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"ドキュメント漁っても全然見つからんくて困惑しました…","ts":"1631881315.082500","thread_ts":"1631879422.080900","parent_user_id":"UDDCM376D","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"HKVd"}]},{"client_msg_id":"99d90347-5972-42ff-bdba-42ea8fc0ca41","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"create tableならその書き方でいいと思うんですけどね。","ts":"1631881386.082700","thread_ts":"1631879422.080900","edited":{"user":"U06BRP8VD","ts":"1631881407.000000"},"parent_user_id":"UDDCM376D","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"OdD"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a0b39d48-2402-4c97-86ce-bd7d5d84cff3","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"ですよね","ts":"1631881430.083000","thread_ts":"1631879422.080900","parent_user_id":"UDDCM376D","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Cn+5"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ee0a6f5a-ba9b-49c0-88a4-5d550d03f8fe","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"\u003chttps://dev.mysql.com/doc/refman/8.0/en/alter-table.html\u003e\n\u003chttps://dev.mysql.com/doc/refman/8.0/en/create-table.html\u003e\nsyntax合っているように見えるんだけどなぁ…\n```ALTER TABLE tbl_name\n    [alter_option [, alter_option] ...]\n    [partition_options]\n\npartition_options:\n    PARTITION BY\n        { [LINEAR] HASH(expr)\n        | [LINEAR] KEY [ALGORITHM={1 | 2}] (column_list)\n        | RANGE{(expr) | COLUMNS(column_list)}\n        | LIST{(expr) | COLUMNS(column_list)} }\n    [PARTITIONS num]\n    [SUBPARTITION BY\n        { [LINEAR] HASH(expr)\n        | [LINEAR] KEY [ALGORITHM={1 | 2}] (column_list) }\n      [SUBPARTITIONS num]\n    ]\n    [(partition_definition [, partition_definition] ...)]```\n","ts":"1631882155.083200","thread_ts":"1631879422.080900","parent_user_id":"UDDCM376D","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"X4gQH"}]},{"client_msg_id":"385c68aa-da5a-4aab-ba9b-99121451b589","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"その後半の partition by (partition_options) って create-tableのほうからもってきてない? alter tableのほうにもあるよ","ts":"1631882561.083400","thread_ts":"1631879422.080900","edited":{"user":"U06BRP8VD","ts":"1631882580.000000"},"parent_user_id":"UDDCM376D","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"8ZA"}]},{"client_msg_id":"bd91be3d-3b3e-47af-82f8-04d5b51e1706","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"え","ts":"1631882595.083700","thread_ts":"1631879422.080900","parent_user_id":"UDDCM376D","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Yd/M"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3732c901-2f6e-4236-be99-e88a6c7090ac","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"create見ろって書いてあるからそっちが正かと思っていました…\n```partition_options:\n    (see CREATE TABLE options)```","ts":"1631882615.083900","thread_ts":"1631879422.080900","parent_user_id":"UDDCM376D","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"xbu"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b06c2333-904e-4f2c-887b-045525bc988a","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","ts":"1631882643.084100","thread_ts":"1631879422.080900","parent_user_id":"UDDCM376D","files":[{"id":"F02EZSDUQ68","created":1631882641,"timestamp":1631882641,"name":"Untitled.txt","title":"Untitled","mimetype":"text/plain","image_exif_rotation":0,"filetype":"text","pretty_type":"プレーンテキスト","user":"U06BRP8VD","mode":"snippet","editable":true,"is_external":false,"external_type":"","size":761,"url":"","url_download":"","url_private":"https://files.slack.com/files-pri/T03C4RC8V-F02EZSDUQ68/untitled.txt","url_private_download":"https://files.slack.com/files-pri/T03C4RC8V-F02EZSDUQ68/download/untitled.txt","original_h":0,"original_w":0,"thumb_64":"","th